  "historical_output_text": " A warm and rainy Monday dawn had found its rhythm. A familiar routine—steamy coffeelots on a countertoulk—when I found it; hidden amidst piles. It sat unassimiated by my daily brew rituals—an ordinary teatapot now transformed from mere container.\n\nAn artifact from years not yet long gone but now hushingly forgotten. It sparked the familiar thrill, like meeting up a childhood pet at 5, after not being around the same for a season.\n\nWith hands slightly damp but sure enough they lifted my relic; I carried her carefully home with no clear intention save a need felt like hunger but without food, merely wanting to cruddle and cherish this piece from days that are both gone & lingering simultaneously as now is my time with its teablocks steepen in water and memories swell inside her again.\n\nI'll use your passage from my writing",
